    howToEn: "„Adaugă” (add) opens „Adaugă grup nou” (add a new group): choose „Țintă” (target) — „Proprietate”, „Persoană fizică”, „Persoană juridică” or „Document” —, write „Descriere” (description) and press „Salvează” (save). The code, of the form GRP-001, is given on saving. „Editează” (edit) on the group's row opens the screen where you choose its members.\n\nOn a record, its groups sit in the „Etichete și grupuri” (tags and groups) tile; a record can belong to at most three groups. You find a group's members in „Căutare globală” (global search), by „Cod grup” (group code). „Șterge” (delete) deletes the group with no way back, but the records in it stay in the archive.",
