    howToEn: "Search in the box at the top of the list by code, nickname, cadastral number, land-registry number, tarla or parcela; the list has no filters. „Deschide” (open) on a row opens the property, and „Adaugă proprietate” (add property) creates a new one.\n\n„Câmpuri afișate” (the columns shown) adds up to four columns after „Poreclă”; at the fourth, the other boxes turn grey until you untick one. The choice is kept in this browser only. The property's code has no column: you find it on its screen.\n\n„Hartă completă” (full map) opens the map of all properties.",
