    backgroundEn: "The map „Toate Proprietățile” (all properties) shows on one screen every piece of land in the archive that has corners, each as a blue shape; a property without corners does not appear. Here you look and measure: a parcel's corners are changed on its own screen, on the „Hartă” tile.",
    howToEn: "A click inside a property opens its bubble, with „Deschide” (open) and „Navighează” (directions); a double-click opens it directly. A property that blinks pink is entered twice in the archive.\n\n„Riglă” (ruler) measures a distance and snaps to a corner near the click; „Unghiuri” (angles) shows a corner's angle. The two area buttons calculate the area of a zone; while one is pressed the rest of the map does not respond, so press it again to release it. None of this is saved.\n\nCareful: „Șterge selecția” (delete the selection), after „Selectează” (select), deletes the properties from the archive, not just the selection.",
